  - data/raw/hsls/hsls_df_knn_impute_past_v2.pkl is copied unmodified from
    that repository.
  - src/data/datasets.py reimplements its datasets/*/prepare_*.py and
    datasets/Dataloader.py.
  - src/unlearning/baselines.py follows its fair_retraining.py (SISA, PRU),
    which adapts code by Izzo et al. (2021).

Third-party data, under their own terms:
  - Adult: UCI Machine Learning Repository (data/raw/adult/).
  - COMPAS: ProPublica, propublica/compas-analysis (data/raw/compas/).
  - HSLS:09 codebooks: National Center for Education Statistics
    (data/raw/hsls/*.txt).
